; SC-3000 port names for the Disassembler window, in Emulicious' .ports
; format: <hex port> <name> [in|out]; without a direction the name serves
; both. A file of the same name in a project's folder takes its place.
; The keyboard and joysticks are an 8255 PPI at $DC-$DF.

7F Port_PSG out

BE Port_VDPData
BF Port_VDPAddress out
BF Port_VDPStatus in

DC Port_PPI_A in
DD Port_PPI_B in
DE Port_PPI_C
DF Port_PPI_Control out
